#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:5 30c8f9c0b74442139d692ddc9afc7d7b
msgid "RPM Measurement"
msgstr "RPM测量"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:7 6223e2594e604228a2b405e9c97691b9
msgid ""
"ArduPilot supports the use of numerous types of RPM sensors.  They are "
"commonly used in traditional helicopters to measure main rotor speed and "
"motor/engine RPM. RPM sensors are mandatory for those who wish to use the "
"closed-loop throttle governor functionality available to helicopters.  "
"Additionally, vehicles that employ 2-stroke and 4-stroke Internal Combustion"
" Engines (ICE) use RPM sensors are for ignition timing.  The same rpm sensor"
" can be used to log engine RPM in ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot支持多种类型的RPM传感器。这些传感器常用于传统直升机以测量主旋翼转速和电机/发动机RPM。对于希望使用直升机闭环油门调速功能的用户，RPM传感器是必须的。此外，使用二冲程和四冲程内燃机（ICE）的飞行器也使用RPM传感器进行点火正时控制。同一RPM传感器还可用于在ArduPilot中记录发动机RPM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:11 cfa6dc3f55c9492fb4ee7c12a188c0a6
msgid "Common types of RPM sensor that can be used in ArduPilot:"
msgstr "可在ArduPilot中使用的常见RPM传感器类型："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:13 571a99eaaa8c428f9f133fa45e87efa7
msgid "Hall effect"
msgstr "霍尔效应"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:14 620982e1145949efa72f3f1ca649abe7
msgid "ESC Telemetry"
msgstr "ESC 数传"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:15 88de3b0400c44e218aa90786aed856c0
msgid "Electrical commutation"
msgstr "电气换相"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:16 10628f5806324f85a025fc336e3dcc09
msgid "Optical"
msgstr "光学式"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:18 e6fb21236ab44242b1b7b93b2a4aed6d
msgid ""
"in addition, a pseudo RPM sensor which reports the center frequency of the "
"dynamic harmonic notch filter is also an option."
msgstr "此外，还有一种伪RPM传感器，可报告动态谐波陷波滤波器的中心频率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:20 53afb6ed18ee471ba76784bf18c8f483
msgid ""
"Any RPM sensor that outputs a step-change in voltage as a function of RPM "
"can be used with ArduPilot.  A brief explanation of how the RPM library "
"works is given.  This is followed by instructions for how to setup the "
"different types of RPM sensor.  Up to two RPM sensors can be used."
msgstr ""
"任何能够根据RPM输出电压阶跃变化的RPM传感器均可与ArduPilot配合使用。以下简要介绍RPM库的工作原理，然后提供不同类型RPM传感器的设置说明。最多可使用两个RPM传感器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:24 e4650658c44c40b1a66e836c80ba2206
msgid "How the RPM Library Works (TYPE = AUXPIN)"
msgstr "RPM库的工作原理（TYPE = AUXPIN）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:26 f9857d748f1645f48e6a761303a3d379
msgid ""
"The RPM library in ArduPilot monitors the voltage of the designated signal "
"pin. The image below shows a typical output voltage of an RPM sensor:"
msgstr "ArduPilot中的RPM库监测指定信号引脚的电压。下图为RPM传感器的典型输出电压波形："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:32 8ade0bbf8f3c4d99aae9753dd6afb4d7
msgid ""
"As it can be seen the voltage oscillates between 0V and 5V.  The voltage "
"drops are either caused by a magnet passing a hall effect sensor, or are the"
" output of a different type of sensor(eg. optical).  When a 'falling edge' "
"is detected the time is stored.  When the voltage drops again the time "
"difference between the falling edges can be calculated.  The time between "
"the voltage drops is proportional to the RPM.  The scaling value that "
"correlates the time between the falling edges and the RPM is dependent upon "
"the setup and device being used.  Device-specific advice on scaling "
"parameters is given later in this guide."
msgstr ""
"可以看出，电压在0V和5V之间振荡。电压下降是由磁铁经过霍尔效应传感器或其他类型传感器（如光学传感器）的输出引起的。当检测到「下降沿」时，记录时间。当电压再次下降时，可计算两次下降沿之间的时间差。下降沿之间的时间与RPM成比例关系。将时间差与RPM关联的缩放值取决于所使用的设置和设备。设备特定的缩放参数建议将在本指南后续部分给出。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:37 313f81deb6b34d86806b935458b7fc01
msgid ""
"In this example, the output is from an electrical commutation sensor, "
"connected to a motor with 4 poles.  The RPM can be calculated as follows:"
msgstr "在此示例中，输出来自一个电气换相传感器，连接到一个4极电机。RPM的计算方式如下："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:43 cea97498d64a4d55bff4eb347c1d08d7
msgid ""
"Where dt is the time between falling edges (in seconds) and S is the scaling"
" factor.  In this example, 4 poles means that there will be 4 wave periods "
"per revolution. Hence, the scaling factor would be 0.25 and the resulting "
"RPM would be 5282.  This is a somewhat simplistic view of how ArduPilot "
"calculates the RPM, but it illustrates the key underlying concepts."
msgstr ""
"其中dt为下降沿之间的时间（单位：秒），S为缩放系数。在此示例中，4极意味着每转有4个波形周期。因此，缩放系数为0.25，计算得到的RPM为5282。这是ArduPilot计算RPM的简化说明，但阐述了关键的基本概念。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:48 fdc3c60f11a84e2893b5f99f5614ccd3
msgid "Hall Effect Sensors"
msgstr "霍尔效应传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:50 ce5128f4327d4bd4bf8125e4c35be4fd
msgid "**Hardware Setup**"
msgstr "**硬件设置**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:52 1eb48c142c814d2e944ee6e6f93e5e59
msgid ""
"Perhaps the most often used, hall effect sensors change their output voltage"
" in the presence of a sufficiently strong magnetic field.  A magnet needs to"
" be fixed to the rotating component that is to be measured.  For "
"helicopters, this requires that a hole or recess is made in the autorotation"
" tail drive wheel and the magnet glued in place (as in the image below).  "
"For ICE the magnet will be mounted in the output shaft."
msgstr ""
"霍尔效应传感器是最常用的类型之一，当存在足够强的磁场时，其输出电压会发生变化。需要将磁铁固定在待测量的旋转部件上。对于直升机，需要在自转尾传动轮上开孔或制作凹槽，并将磁铁粘入（如下图所示）。对于ICE，磁铁将安装在输出轴上。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:60 a8315e0773e54a5ebce6339a2ed4decd
msgid ""
"The polarity of the magnet matters.  Only one pole will create the change in"
" voltage required.  To ensure that the magnet is affixed in the correct "
"orientation either an oscilloscope or the `Arduino sketch found here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_RPM/examples/ArduinoHallEffectDebug.ino>`__"
" can be used.  If using an oscilloscope, this guide assumes that you have "
"sufficient knowledge to be able to set up this test.  If using the Arduino "
"sketch method in the link provided, a comprehensive set of instructions are "
"commented at the beginning of the sketch.  An Arduino Uno was used when "
"writing and testing the sketch and is recommended."
msgstr ""
"磁铁的极性很重要，只有一个磁极能产生所需的电压变化。为确保磁铁以正确方向固定，可使用示波器或 `此处提供的Arduino程序 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_RPM/examples/ArduinoHallEffectDebug.ino>`__。如果使用示波器，本指南假定您有足够的知识来设置此测试。如果使用链接中提供的Arduino程序方法，程序开头有详细的操作说明。编写和测试该程序时使用的是Arduino"
" Uno，建议使用该型号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:68 d6cab890beed460e9728f98d5a300b0e
msgid ""
"Most hall effect sensors that are intended for use with radio control "
"vehicles will require some additional modification.  Often, they will need "
"an additional pull-up resistor to be added between the Vcc and signal lines."
"  In some cases, their Vcc, gnd, and signal lines won't match the colour "
"coding of the wire.  Hence, it is advisable to experiment with the provided "
"Arduino sketch and a bread board to be sure of the sensor pin orientation."
msgstr ""
"大多数针对遥控车辆设计的霍尔效应传感器需要进行一些额外改装。通常，它们需要在Vcc和信号线之间增加一个上拉电阻。某些情况下，Vcc、地线和信号线的颜色编码可能与导线颜色不符。因此，建议使用提供的Arduino程序和面包板进行实验，以确认传感器引脚方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:72 29eb70ba2daa440c946a535a4108869d
msgid ""
"For a reliable RPM signal the hall effect pick-up should be mounted very "
"close to the magnet.  The image below shows an example mounting on a "
"helicopter."
msgstr "为获得可靠的RPM信号，霍尔效应传感器应安装在距磁铁非常近的位置。下图为直升机上的安装示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:78 1d7430151bba45afb6007b20f272c430
msgid ""
"The three wires should then be plugged into the autopilot.  This is commonly"
" done using a standard servo plug.  Ground to Gnd, Vcc to 5V, and the signal"
" line needs to be attached to a GPIO pin.  On most smaller boards this will "
"be any one of the PWM pins on the servo rail.  On a Pixhawk this must be one"
" of the AUX ports. For reasons explained later it is recommended to use the "
"highest number pin first.  E.g. AUX 6 on a Pixhawk/Cube or PWM 9 on a "
"MatekF405-Wing."
msgstr ""
"三根导线应插入飞控。通常使用标准舵机插头完成连接。地线接GND，Vcc接5V，信号线需连接到GPIO引脚。在大多数较小的飞控板上，这可以是舵机轨道上的任意PWM引脚。在Pixhawk上，必须使用AUX端口之一。出于后文解释的原因，建议优先使用编号最大的引脚。例如Pixhawk/Cube上的AUX"
" 6或MatekF405-Wing上的PWM 9。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:82 3078c67644eb47e8a802d24d0ce5040e
msgid "**Parameter Setup**"
msgstr "**参数设置**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:84 d66b21117c874e1290e4cfe60dbbcabf
msgid ""
"First the board needs to be configured to allow PWM pins to be set for GPIO."
"  This is done using the parameter ``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` .  Reduce the PWM count"
" to free up a pin to be used for GPIO.  On non-Pixhawk boards the PWM count "
"will include all PWM outputs.  On Pixhawk boards this parameter only affects"
" AUX pins.  Write the parameter and reboot the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"首先需要配置飞控板，允许将PWM引脚设置为GPIO。这通过参数 ``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` "
"完成。降低PWM数量以释放一个引脚用作GPIO。对于非Pixhawk飞控板，PWM数量包含所有PWM输出。对于Pixhawk飞控板，该参数仅影响AUX引脚。写入参数后重启飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:86 70f9740e82534a07b527d87f46327183
msgid ""
"in firmware versions 4.2 and later, the method for setting a PWM/SERVO/MOTOR"
" output to be a GPIO function is changed. Instead of ``BRD_PWM_COUNT`` being"
" used, the individual ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` parameter is merely set to \"-1\"."
" If set to \"0\", it remains a PWM output, unassigned to a function, and "
"outputs that output's trim value when board safety is not active. If the "
"servo function is being \"mirrored\" to a remote device, as in the case of a"
" DroneCAN or KDECAN ESC, then in order to change the autopilot board's "
"corresponding output pin to be a GPIO, but allow the ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` to "
"still be assigned to the remote device, the "
":ref:`SERVO_GPIO_MASK<SERVO_GPIO_MASK>` parameter can be used to assign the "
"board pin to be a GPIO without affecting the ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` assignment "
"for the remote device."
msgstr ""
"在固件版本4.2及更高版本中，将PWM/SERVO/MOTOR输出设置为GPIO功能的方法已更改。不再使用 "
"``BRD_PWM_COUNT``，而是将对应的 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` "
"参数设置为「-1」即可。如果设置为「0」，则该输出仍为PWM输出，未分配功能，在飞控安全开关未激活时输出该输出的微调值。如果舵机功能被「镜像」到远程设备（例如DroneCAN或KDECAN"
" ESC），则为了将飞控板对应输出引脚改为GPIO但仍让 ``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 分配给远程设备，可使用 "
":ref:`SERVO_GPIO_MASK<SERVO_GPIO_MASK>` 参数将飞控板引脚设为GPIO，同时不影响远程设备的 "
"``SERVOx_FUNCTION`` 分配。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:88 90b5991e25f0459f8b6e785729dd94c9
msgid ""
"Now the RPM library must be enabled. In the following sections, we will use "
"the second instance of RPM sensor for parameter examples. Up to four "
"different sensors(instances) can be used."
msgstr "现在需要启用RPM库。在以下章节中，我们将以第二个RPM传感器实例为例介绍参数设置。最多可使用四个不同的传感器（实例）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:90 cd1e53628e5245d7b5616426568700c2
msgid ""
"Set the parameter :ref:`RPM2_TYPE<RPM2_TYPE>` to 2 for a GPIO pin based "
"sensor.  Write the parameter to ArduPilot then refresh/fetch the parameters."
"  You will now find that the instance of RPM (e.g. RPM2) has a number of "
"other parameters available for editing, allowing you to complete your setup."
msgstr ""
"将参数 :ref:`RPM2_TYPE<RPM2_TYPE>` "
"设置为2，使用基于GPIO引脚的传感器。将参数写入ArduPilot后刷新/获取参数。此时将看到该RPM实例（如RPM2）下出现了更多可编辑参数，可用于完成设置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:93 b23c897f6050451b83fe4cbf7d5fd669
msgid ""
"Now the autopilot needs to be told which pin to find the RPM signal on.  To "
"do this you will need to find the pin number in the hwdef.dat file for your "
"board.  These can be found `here "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef>`__."
"  Within the file for your board you will need to find where the GPIO(*) "
"definition is.  The pin must have a timer assigned. Normally, these will be "
"PWM servo/motor outputs that have been designated as a GPIO instead of PWM "
"output. See :ref:`common-gpios`, for more information."
msgstr ""
"现在需要告知飞控在哪个引脚上读取RPM信号。为此需要在您的飞控板的hwdef.dat文件中查找引脚编号。这些文件可以在 `此处 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/tree/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef>`__"
" "
"找到。在您飞控板的文件中，需要找到GPIO(*)定义的位置。该引脚必须分配有定时器。通常，这些是被指定为GPIO而非PWM输出的PWM舵机/电机输出端口。更多信息请参阅"
" :ref:`common-gpios`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:97 4ac81fee157d4a1d96f973f75394b67c
msgid ""
"for example, if we have set AUX port 5 to a GPIO and its GPIO numbering "
"corresponds to pin 54, 54 must be entered into the parameter "
":ref:`RPM2_PIN<RPM2_PIN>` for the RPM sensor."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果将AUX端口5设置为GPIO，其GPIO编号对应引脚54，则需要在参数 :ref:`RPM2_PIN<RPM2_PIN>` "
"中输入54作为RPM传感器的引脚编号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:99 eee4f5f8e46e4b42919803cec2453c7c
msgid ""
"The parameter :ref:`RPM2SCALING<RPM2_SCALING>` will correspond to the number"
" magnets used.  Most commonly only one magnet is used and this parameter is "
"set to 1.  Some installations use 2 magnets, 180 degrees out of phase.  In "
"this case this parameter should be set to 0.5."
msgstr ""
"参数 :ref:`RPM2SCALING<RPM2_SCALING>` "
"对应所使用的磁铁数量。通常只使用一个磁铁，此时参数设为1。某些安装使用两个相差180度的磁铁，此时该参数应设为0.5。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:102 61be08283f99434688b4f29d79cf1c91
msgid ""
"Initially, it is recommended to leave the parameters "
":ref:`RPM2_MIN<RPM2_MIN>`, :ref:`RPM2_MAX<RPM2_MAX>`, and "
":ref:`RPM2_MIN_QUAL<RPM2_MIN_QUAL>` as their defaults.  If an RPM signal "
"exceeds any of these limits then the value reported in the ground station "
"and the logs is zero.  Therefore, only adjust these values once you have "
"confirmed that your RPM sensor is working as expected, otherwise it can make"
" it more difficult to debug if nothing is getting reported."
msgstr ""
"最初，建议保持参数 :ref:`RPM2_MIN<RPM2_MIN>`、:ref:`RPM2_MAX<RPM2_MAX>` 和 "
":ref:`RPM2_MIN_QUAL<RPM2_MIN_QUAL>` "
"的默认值。如果RPM信号超出这些限制，则在地面站和日志中报告的值为零。因此，只有在确认RPM传感器工作正常后，才能调整这些值，否则在没有任何数据上报时调试会更加困难。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:104 c6ccdbd4f8ef483199ee7ef5a31af3f3
msgid ""
"Finally, to test that everything is working, you can use the rpm1/rpm2 live "
"feeds in the quick tab in mission planner or the live tuning window.  "
"Alternatively the RPM history can be reviewed in the logs."
msgstr ""
"最后，若要测试一切是否正常工作，可在Mission "
"Planner的快速标签或实时调参窗口中使用rpm1/rpm2实时数据。也可以在日志中查看RPM历史记录。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:108 3089a7e504964972add6f317219eed05
msgid "ESC Telemetry - Average Motor RPM"
msgstr "ESC数传 - 平均电机RPM"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:110 0698d5b1707c4572a06076cb701a830b
msgid ""
"The RPM library can also be used to setup an 'RPM sensor' that computes and "
"logs the average RPM for selected motors on the vehicle that are controlled "
"by BLHeli_32 or BLHeli_S capable ESCs.  First the ESC telemetry will need to"
" be setup.  See :ref:`BLHeli Telemetry<blheli32-esc-telemetry>` for details "
"on how to do this.  Once complete set ``RPMx_TYPE`` to 5 and write the "
"parameters to ArduPilot.  Then refresh/fetch the parameters.  You will find "
"a number of additional parameters are now available for that instance.  Find"
" and set ``RPMx_ESC_MASK`` to add which ESC channels you want to be included"
" in the average. For example for the second RPM instance:"
msgstr ""
"RPM库还可用于设置一个「RPM传感器」，该传感器计算并记录飞行器上由BLHeli_32或BLHeli_S兼容ESC控制的选定电机的平均RPM。首先需要设置ESC数传。有关设置方法的详情，请参阅"
" :ref:`BLHeli数传<blheli32-esc-telemetry>`。设置完成后，将 ``RPMx_TYPE`` "
"设置为5并将参数写入ArduPilot，然后刷新/获取参数。您将看到该实例下有更多附加参数可用。找到并设置 "
"``RPMx_ESC_MASK``，添加要纳入平均计算的ESC通道。例如对于第二个RPM实例："

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:112 55b280a82af743bba0766ded6824d34f
msgid ""
":ref:`RPM2_ESC_MASK<RPM2_ESC_MASK>` is a bitmask, with each bit "
"corresponding to a channel. If you wanted the average RPM for motors 1 to 4 "
"you would set :ref:`RPM2_ESC_MASK<RPM2_ESC_MASK>` = 1 + 2 + 4 + 8 = 15."
msgstr ""
":ref:`RPM2_ESC_MASK<RPM2_ESC_MASK>` 是一个位掩码，每一位对应一个通道。如果要计算电机1至4的平均RPM，则将 "
":ref:`RPM2_ESC_MASK<RPM2_ESC_MASK>` 设为 1 + 2 + 4 + 8 = 15。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:115 9a075070e5d144d08515e5b5c9803980
msgid "Electrical Commutation Sensors"
msgstr "电气换相传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:117 d67e0cd6e5154053a35378bd2a118d08
msgid ""
"Electrical commutation RPM sensors can be added retrospectively using "
"something like the Hobbywing brushless RPM sensor.  Some ESCs, such as the "
"Castle Creations Edge series, that have an auxiliary output, can be "
"configured to output a pulse per commutation."
msgstr ""
"电气换相RPM传感器可通过Hobbywing无刷RPM传感器等设备进行追加安装。某些具有辅助输出的ESC（如Castle Creations "
"Edge系列）可配置为每次换相输出一个脉冲。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:120 feeca830c13b41d0bfb077d3a117709f
msgid ""
"For clarification, this is not the same as the RPM that can be passed via "
"serial telemetry with ESCs.  For information on how to set up RPM reporting "
"with capable ESCs, see the :ref:`ESC Telemetry<blheli32-esc-telemetry>`."
msgstr ""
"需要说明的是，这与通过串行数传传递的ESC RPM不同。有关如何设置兼容ESC的RPM上报，请参阅 :ref:`ESC数传<blheli32-esc-"
"telemetry>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:123 d23af868e52c4a4aa43588de103eb0e6
msgid ""
"The setup for electrical commutation RPM sensors is much the same as hall "
"effect sensors, so the steps above are applicable.  The only difference is "
"the scaling value to be entered in the :ref:`RPMN2_SCALING<RPM2_SCALING>` "
"parameter.  Now, the scaling value is a function of the number of poles in "
"the motor and should be the reciprocal of the number of pole pairs.  E.g. A "
"motor with 20 poles, therefore 10 pole pairs, needs a scaling value of 1/10 "
"= 0.1."
msgstr ""
"电气换相RPM传感器的设置与霍尔效应传感器基本相同，因此上述步骤同样适用。唯一的区别是在 "
":ref:`RPMN2_SCALING<RPM2_SCALING>` "
"参数中输入的缩放值。此时，缩放值取决于电机极数，应为极对数的倒数。例如，一个20极（即10极对）的电机，缩放值应为1/10 = 0.1。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:128 0ae61444a5e044a7913a9a5c7f7dec7d
msgid "Optical Sensors"
msgstr "光学传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:130 2f7cf3e313fb4a7eab0db65d329a1798
msgid ""
"Again, the setup of optical sensors is much the same as the hall effect "
"sensor.  The only difference is the scaling value.  "
":ref:`RPM2_SCALING<RPM2_SCALING>` should be set to be the reciprocal of the "
"number of reflective obstacles that pass the sensor in a single rotation."
msgstr ""
"光学传感器的设置与霍尔效应传感器基本相同，唯一区别是缩放值。:ref:`RPM2_SCALING<RPM2_SCALING>` "
"应设置为每转经过传感器的反射障碍物数量的倒数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:134 90ffa0ba87394f73bc3219b5509bb696
msgid "Harmonic Notch Center Frequency"
msgstr "谐波陷波中心频率"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rpm.rst:136 0bd99299023d4171894bba381f303637
msgid ""
"If ``RPMx_TYPE`` = 4, then the center frequency of the harmonic notch is "
"reported.  See :ref:`common-imu-notch-filtering` for how this value is "
"obtained."
msgstr ""
"如果 ``RPMx_TYPE`` = 4，则报告谐波陷波滤波器的中心频率。有关该值的获取方式，请参阅 :ref:`common-imu-notch-"
"filtering`。"

